{"id":"steam-1176924","steam":1176924,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"Lock 'n Load Tactical Digital: Heroes of the Motherland Battlepack 1","summary":"The Lock ’n Load Tactical Series advances into World War II’s Eastern Front with Heroes of the Motherland. The fate of the Soviet Rodina is at stake depicting ferocious battles across the Russian steppe, in the ruins of Stalingrad, and in Partisan-infested woods.","about":"Into the Endless Plains of Russia\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Lock ’n Load Tactical Series advances into World War II’s Eastern Front with Heroes of the Motherland. The fate of the Soviet Rodina is at stake depicting ferocious battles across the Russian steppe, in the ruins of Stalingrad, and in Partisan-infested woods. From infantry spurred on by Commissars to intrepid Guards and stoic Partisans, the Soviets are poised for anything the German Wehrmacht and SS throw at them. It’s a soldier against soldier and tank against the tank. No matter the forces or the setting, the Soviets are poised to defend their homeland to the end.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176924/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1619194637","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176924/header.jpg?t=1619194637","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176924/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1619194637","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176924/header.jpg?t=1619194637","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176924/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1619194637","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176924/ss_73e9354dc020fee83525e25659a55ceb51c151eb.600x338.jpg?t=1619194637","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176924/ss_73e9354dc020fee83525e25659a55ceb51c151eb.jpg?t=1619194637"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.ste